    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, we've finally got some solid results on the oncology lead. Since we're moving the successful molecular structure into the clinical validation phase, we need to clean up the workspace. Can you go ahead and prune all the intermediate reasoning logs, experimental scratchpads, and the iterative modeling pathways used during the discovery phase? We only need to keep the final validated structures and the summary reports for the audit trail. Thanks.",
